<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="csrf-token" content="<%= csrfToken %>">
    <title>Katalog Undangan Digital - Wedding Invitation</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css">
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-50 via-white to-gold-50">
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-gray-100">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-7xl flex items-center justify-between py-4">
            <a href="/" class="flex items-center">
                <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-primary-600" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M3.172 5.172a4 4 0 015.656 0L10 6.343l1.172-1.171a4 4 0 115.656 5.656L10 17.657l-6.828-6.829a4 4 0 010-5.656z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                </svg>
                <span class="ml-2 text-lg font-serif font-bold text-gray-800">Wedding Invitation</span>
            </a>
            <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 md:gap-4">
                <a href="#katalog" class="hidden md:inline-block px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 hover:text-primary-700 transition-colors">Katalog</a>
                <a href="#cara-order" class="hidden md:inline-block px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 hover:text-primary-700 transition-colors">Cara Order</a>
                <a href="/login" class="inline-block px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white bg-primary-600 hover:bg-primary-700 rounded-xl transition-colors">Masuk</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="py-16 md:py-24 text-center">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-3xl">
            <p class="text-sm tracking-widest uppercase text-gold-600 font-medium mb-4">Undangan Pernikahan Digital</p>
            <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-6xl text-gray-900 leading-tight mb-6">
                Pilih template, isi data acara, sebarkan tautan
            </h1>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-4">
                Setiap template dilengkapi hitung mundur, galeri, amplop digital, RSVP, dan buku ucapan. Kelola semuanya dari dashboard sendiri.
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">
                Mulai dengan trial 7 hari. Upgrade kapan saja untuk memperpanjang masa aktif.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center">
                <a href="#katalog"
                   class="inline-flex items-center px-8 py-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-600 to-primary-500 text-white rounded-xl font-medium hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200">
                    Lihat Katalog
                </a>
                <a href="/login"
                   class="inline-flex items-center px-8 py-4 bg-white border border-gray-200 text-gray-700 rounded-xl font-medium hover:border-primary-300 hover:text-primary-700 transition-all duration-200">
                    Masuk ke Dashboard
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <main id="katalog" class="container mx-auto px-4 pb-8 max-w-7xl scroll-mt-24">
        <div class="text-center mb-10">
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif text-gray-800 mb-3">Katalog Template</h2>
            <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-gold-500 to-transparent mx-auto"></div>
        </div>

        <% if (templates.length) { %>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
            <% templates.forEach(function(t, i) { %>
            <article class="group bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-md overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 border border-gray-100 flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="relative h-36 bg-gradient-to-br <%= previews[t.slug] || 'from-primary-600 via-primary-500 to-primary-400' %> overflow-hidden">
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20">
                            <div class="absolute top-0 -left-4 w-40 h-40 bg-white rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-xl"></div>
                            <div class="absolute top-0 -right-4 w-40 h-40 bg-gold-300 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-xl"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="relative z-10 h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-white p-4 text-center">
                            <span class="text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase mb-1 opacity-80">The Wedding Of</span>
                            <h3 class="font-script text-2xl sm:text-3xl leading-tight mb-1 truncate max-w-full px-2"><%= t.name %></h3>
                            <span class="text-[11px] opacity-80">Pratinjau Desain</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="p-5">
                        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2 mb-2">
                            <h3 class="text-base font-serif font-bold text-gray-800"><%= t.name %></h3>
                            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-primary-700 whitespace-nowrap"><%= formatIDR(t.price) %></p>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-4 line-clamp-2 leading-relaxed"><%= t.description || '' %></p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="p-5 pt-0 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                    <a href="/template-<%= t.slug.replace('template-', '') %>"
                       class="block text-center px-3 py-2 border border-gray-200 text-gray-700 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold hover:border-primary-400 hover:text-primary-700 transition-colors">
                        Lihat Demo
                    </a>
                    <a href="/order/<%= t.slug %>"
                       class="block text-center px-3 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-600 to-primary-500 text-white rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-200">
                        Pesan
                    </a>
                </div>
            </article>
            <% }); %>
        </div>
        <% } else { %>
        <div class="text-center py-16 bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-xl">
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg">Katalog sedang disiapkan. Silakan kembali lagi.</p>
        </div>
        <% } %>
    </main>

    <section id="cara-order" class="container mx-auto px-4 py-16 max-w-5xl scroll-mt-24">
        <div class="text-center mb-10">
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif text-gray-800 mb-3">Cara Order</h2>
            <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-gold-500 to-transparent mx-auto"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8 border border-gray-100">
                <p class="text-sm font-bold text-primary-600 mb-2">Langkah 1</p>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-serif text-gray-800 mb-2">Pilih template</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600">Buka demo setiap template, lalu tekan Pesan pada yang cocok.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8 border border-gray-100">
                <p class="text-sm font-bold text-primary-600 mb-2">Langkah 2</p>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-serif text-gray-800 mb-2">Daftar dan isi data</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600">Buat akun, tentukan alamat undangan, lalu lengkapi nama, tanggal, dan venue dari dashboard. Trial 7 hari langsung aktif.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8 border border-gray-100">
                <p class="text-sm font-bold text-primary-600 mb-2">Langkah 3</p>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-serif text-gray-800 mb-2">Bayar dan sebarkan</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600">Upgrade untuk memperpanjang masa aktif, lalu sebarkan tautan undangan ke tamu.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="border-t border-gray-100 py-10">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-7xl flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-primary-600" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M3.172 5.172a4 4 0 015.656 0L10 6.343l1.172-1.171a4 4 0 115.656 5.656L10 17.657l-6.828-6.829a4 4 0 010-5.656z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                </svg>
                <span class="ml-2 font-serif font-bold text-gray-800">Wedding Invitation</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm">
                <a href="#katalog" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-primary-700 transition-colors">Katalog</a>
                <a href="/login" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-primary-700 transition-colors">Masuk</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script>
        const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
            entries.forEach(entry => {
                if (entry.isIntersecting) {
                    entry.target.classList.add('animated');
                    observer.unobserve(entry.target);
                }
            });
        }, { threshold: 0.1 });

        document.querySelectorAll('.animate-on-scroll').forEach(el => {
            observer.observe(el);
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
